    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"find peace\"... that sounds almost beautiful, in a way. but i'm scared of just... waiting for it to happen to me. like, if i just sit here, does that mean i've lost? is there a way to actually take control of it, instead of just being a victim to whatever comes through those gates?",
