    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "numbing the pain... or just leaving it all behind entirely. i guess i mean, is there a way to meet this end with some kind of dignity? like, instead of just being broken and terrified when the gates finally give way, is there a way to choose how it happens? to have a bit of grace in the final moment?",
